      "content": "Hi, I'm preparing a lecture demonstration for my Year 11 chemistry class on the biochemical reaction that occurs when cutting onions. Could you provide a detailed breakdown of the chemical pathway that leads to the eye irritation? I'd like to explain the specific enzymes and volatile compounds involved in the process.",
